{"id":5903,"date":"2026-03-27T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-03-27T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=5903"},"modified":"2026-04-10T13:49:27","modified_gmt":"2026-04-10T12:49:27","slug":"tax-stress-avoid-it-with-these-practical-tips","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/tax-stress-avoid-it-with-these-practical-tips\/","title":{"rendered":"Tax stress? Avoid it with these practical tips!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Taxes: the word alone can cause panic for entrepreneurs. Deadlines, regulations, tax returns\u2014it all takes time, but there really is no need to stress about it! With a few smart habits and practical tips, you maintain an overview and peace of mind.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this blog, we give you practical tips to make things a lot easier for yourself and prevent tax stress.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">#1: Know what is expected of you (and when)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Much stress is caused by uncertainty, so make sure to schedule the most important tax moments in your calendar. As a starting entrepreneur, you will mainly have to deal with:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>VAT Return (When can depend on the country you are from)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Income tax (once a year)<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Add these deadlines to your calendar immediately and enable an automatic reminder. That way, you won&#8217;t have to keep thinking about it in between, and you&#8217;ll be notified on time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tip: even if you haven&#8217;t had any revenue, you often still have to file a tax return!<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">#2: Keep your records organized<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Administration sounds bigger than it is; it doesn&#8217;t have to be difficult as long as you keep up with it. As accounting expert Marjan Heemskerk says: \u201cYou keep books primarily for yourself, not just for the Tax Authorities.\u201d A few simple habits can make a world of difference:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Use a\u00a0<strong>separate business bank account<\/strong>\u00a0.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keep your\u00a0<strong>receipts and invoices in digital format<\/strong>\u00a0.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Update your accounts\u00a0<strong>regularly<\/strong>\u00a0(weekly or monthly).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don&#8217;t view your administration as something for later, but as a tool for yourself. The better you have an overview, the less stress you will experience regarding your tax return.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">#3 Use Aids<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are plenty of tools that can help you with the subject of tax; you certainly don&#8217;t have to do it all yourself! Consider:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Accounting software:<\/strong>\u00a0It centralizes your income\/expenses and calculates VAT automatically.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Calendar alerts:<\/strong>\u00a0Use\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/support.google.com\/calendar\/answer\/12132599?hl=fr&amp;co=GENIE.Platform%3DAndroid\">dedicated apps<\/a>\u00a0or simple reminders to never miss a deadline.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Webador Export:<\/strong>\u00a0If you have an online store with us, you can\u00a0<strong>export your orders<\/strong>\u00a0for your accounting with a single click. No more manual searching!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do you have a webshop with Webador? Then you&#8217;ve come to the right place! You can easily\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426753095697-Can-I-export-orders-and-invoices-from-my-online-store\">export your orders<\/a>\u00a0for your administration. This way, you don&#8217;t have to search for everything individually, and you&#8217;ll be finished faster.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">#4 Prepare your tax return<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don&#8217;t wait until the day before the deadline. Prepare the ground in advance:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Gather your data:<\/strong>\u00a0Revenue, business expenses, supporting documents.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check your deductions:<\/strong>\u00a0Find out about allowances for self-employed individuals or new entrepreneurs.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Request an extension:<\/strong>\u00a0If you cannot meet the deadline, request a postponement in time.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">#5 Perfection isn&#8217;t necessary, but being on time is!<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the biggest pitfalls for starting entrepreneurs is the idea that everything has to be perfect right away, but that is not necessary at all! The Tax Authorities do not expect a perfect entrepreneur, but an honest entrepreneur who files their return on time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is far more important that you file your return with the information you have at that moment than that you keep delaying because you are still unsure about a detail. Are you unsure about something? You can often adjust it or ask about it later. Correcting a mistake is usually not a problem; being late, however, can cause unnecessary stress.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With a little preparation, established habits, and the right tools, doing your taxes will no longer stress you out. And the less time you spend on peripheral matters, the more room you have left for what you really enjoy: growing your business.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Taxes: the word alone can cause panic for entrepreneurs. Deadlines, regulations, tax returns\u2014it all takes time, but there really is no need to stress about it! With a few smart habits and practical tips, you maintain an overview and peace of mind. In this blog, we give you practical tips to make things a lot&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":21,"featured_media":5904,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"op